Changed :meth:`vDate.from_ical <icalendar.prop.dt.date.vDate.from_ical>` and :meth:`vDatetime.from_ical <icalendar.prop.dt.datetime.vDatetime.from_ical>` to raise :exc:`~icalendar.error.ICalParsingError` for invalid DATE and DATE-TIME values, preserving the malformed input on the exception. I used AI to assist with understanding the issue, debugging, and reviewing the tests and implementation. @sairex53
